":"New York","partners":["kraken","ink","dynamic","cap"],"src":"/events/backers-builders-pearlbox-2026.jpg","alt":"PearlBox bar and floral installation for Backers and Builders in New York","shape":"tall","marks":"$L1c"},{"title":"Dishing over Dishes","proof":"A shared hospitality concept for LayerZero and Boundless in Berlin, with the partnership carried through the dinner and printed table details.","place":"Berlin","partners":["layerzero","boundless"],"src":"/events/dishing-over-dishes.jpg","alt":"Dishing over Dishes table card with tomatoes and candles","shape":"tall","marks":"$L1d"},{"title":"FarCon Open with Zerion and Farcaster","proof":"A courtside collaboration between Zerion and Farcaster, giving their communities a reason to meet and play at Padel Haus in Brooklyn.","place":"Brooklyn","partners":["zerion","farcaster"],"src":"/events/farcon-open-banner.jpg","alt":"Players gathered under the Zerion FarCon Open banner at Padel Haus","shape":"wide","marks":"$L1e"}]}]
